STRING 145
// Abilities: A00A (Devour), Researchubertip (Tooltip - Learn - Extended)
{
Sends a wave of pure mana at the targeted unit. Upon impact the wave blasts all of it's energy into the target, dealing massive damage to it.

Deals 60/120/180/240/300/360/420/480/540/600 + 0.10x Intelligence damage.
Cooldown is 26/24/22/20/18/16/14/12/10/6 seconds.
Mana cost is 50/45/50/55/60/65/70/75/80/80.

}

